                "caption": "Figure 1:Overview of SimpleICL.We identify the prompt ambiguity problem in robot ICL and clarify the intrinsic semantics that the model should learn. We further improve task understanding and generalization through efficient data engineering. Our method achieves the best performance across eight evaluation tasks.",
